Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,I started contacting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,customers before my\Ntools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:03.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not because I was\Nconfident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:07.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Because every week I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,waited, I learned\Nnothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I picked a small\Ngroup of real people and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:12.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,sent the first message.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:19.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then I built the tool to\Nkeep track of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:19.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,A to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:21.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,A follow-up date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:23.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,A place to write down\Nwhat happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:25.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,You don't need the\Nperfect plan to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,You need the next small\Nstep,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,and somewhere to record\Nwhat happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:30.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:33.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm building a business,\Nand the software to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:34.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Follow along.
